        "original_id": "9bb43657-5aa6-55b8-be5b-c40640c204f2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: V (2009 TV series), Rogues' Gallery\n- People: Kenneth Johnson, Elizabeth Mitchell, Morena Baccarin, Scott Rosenbaum, Yves Simoneau, Scott Peters, Steve Pearlman, Jace Hall, Ben McKenzie\n- Concepts: 1983 miniseries, alien species, Arkham Asylum\n\nFacts:\n- Kenneth Johnson created the 1983 miniseries that V (2009 TV series) remade.\n- V (2009 TV series) chronicles the arrival on Earth of a technologically advanced alien species that appears peaceful but has sinister motives.\n- V (2009 TV series) stars Elizabeth Mitchell and Morena Baccarin.\n- Scott Rosenbaum, Yves Simoneau, Scott Peters, Steve Pearlman, and Jace Hall served as executive producers of V (2009 TV series).\n- Morena Baccarin, born on June 2, 1979, is a Brazilian American actress.\n- In Rogues' Gallery, Gordon, played by Ben McKenzie, is transferred to Arkham Asylum and tries to avoid a conflict during an inmate riot with help from Dr. Leslie Thompkins, played by Morena Baccarin.",
